<item>
            <title>[IGNITE-1888] IgniteNode for Yardstick stared without Spring ApplicationContext</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-1888</link>
                <project id="12315922" key="IGNITE">Ignite</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;When I tried to benchmark JdbcPojoStore I got exception: &quot;Spring application context resource is not injected&quot;.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;After investigation (thanks to Valentine Kulichenko) we found that IgniteNode started without app context.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
